# Documentation

- After a feature change, update its file, `docs/planning/IMPLEMENTATION_STATUS.md`, and `docs/planning/IMPLEMENTATION_PROGRESS.md`.
- Update the API or database doc when the contract or schema changes. Add an ADR when an architectural decision changes.
- Do not edit files under `originals/`.
- Write agent-facing docs in English. Leave the Arabic concept unchanged.
- Record executed test commands and results. Do not write that tests passed unless they ran.
